        "text": "Your sales trend this month is **strongly positive and highly profitable**, generating **$337,070 in total revenue** on **$67,800 total spend**, yielding an impressive blended **ROI of 4.97x**. \n\nSales velocity is driven by **312 total conversions** with an average revenue per unit/deal of **~$1,080** and an efficient average **CAC of $217.31**.\n\n### **Key Sales Trend Drivers**\n\n* **Core Volume Drivers (LinkedIn & Google):** High-intent channels account for **$167.3k (49.6%)** of total sales. LinkedIn leads absolute revenue generation at **$88.2k (4.2x ROI)** across 42 high-value enterprise conversions, closely followed by Google Ads at **$79.1k (4.3x ROI)**.\n* **Profitability & Efficiency Engine (Email & SEO):** Email Nurture is your most potent margin driver, converting warm pipeline into **$28.8k in revenue** with an extraordinary **24.0x ROI** across 78 sales. Organic SEO complements this with **$36.0k revenue** at an ultra-low **$70.30 CAC**.\n* **Primary Margin Drag (Meta Ads):** Meta Ads generated **$49.7k in revenue**, but efficiency is severely lagging with a **$458 CAC**—more than double your blended average (**$217.31**)—resulting in your lowest channel ROI (**3.5x**).\n* **Pipeline Health:** With **2,120 qualified leads** generated out of 4,360 total (a strong **48.6% qualification rate**), lead-to-sale velocity indicates sustained sales momentum heading into next month.\n\n---\n\n### **Strategic CMO Recommendation**\nShift **$5,000–$7,000** from Meta Ads into **Google Ads** and **LinkedIn** to capitalize on high-intent buyer demand, while scaling email nurture sequences to convert the remaining **1,808 open MQLs**.\n\n---\n\n### **Suggested Follow-Up Questions**\n1. *\"How should we reallocate our Meta Ads budget to optimize overall CAC and ROI?\"*\n2. *\"What is the projected revenue impact if we double our spend on Organic SEO and LinkedIn?\"*",
